      "id": "be-s11-scp-paradigm-c1",
      "heading": "Structure, conduct and performance",
      "explanation_md": "Industry analysis has three parts:\n\n| Part | What it covers |\n|---|---|\n| **Market structure** | Number and size of firms, industry concentration, technological and cost conditions, demand conditions, ease of entry and exit |\n| **Conduct** | Pricing, advertising, R&D, merger activity |\n| **Performance** | Profitability, social welfare |",
      "example_ids": [],
      "key_terms": [],
      "exam_line": "Structure: firms, concentration, technology, demand, entry. Conduct: pricing, advertising, R&D, mergers. Performance: profits and welfare.",
