    {
      "id": "be-s11-scp-paradigm-c2",
      "heading": "The SCP paradigm and the feedback critique",
      "explanation_md": "- The **Structure-Conduct-Performance (SCP) paradigm** takes a **causal view**: market structure determines conduct, which determines performance.\n- The **feedback critique** says there is **no one-way causal link**: **conduct can affect market structure**, and **performance can affect conduct as well as market structure**.\n\nThe modern approach examines the **interrelationship** between structure, conduct and performance.",
      "example_ids": [],
      "key_terms": [],
      "exam_line": "SCP: structure causes conduct causes performance. Feedback critique: the arrows run both ways.",
